  "permalink": "https://www.25coffee.sk/product/colombia-tumbaga-decaf/",
  "short_description": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>Chuť kávy</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify\">Tumbaga Sugarcane Decaf ponúka vyváženú chuť s výraznými tónmi čokolády, jemnou sladkosťou a hladkým telom. Má nízku aciditu, príjemnú sladkú dochuť a pôsobí harmonicky aj napriek tomu, že je bez kofeínu.</p>\n<h2>Špecifikácie</h2>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-9572\" src=\"https://www.25coffee.sk/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/zem-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" /> Krajina pôvodu: Kolumbia<br />\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-9574\" src=\"https://www.25coffee.sk/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/region.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" /> Región: Cauca, Tolima, Antioquia<br />\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-9575\" src=\"https://www.25coffee.sk/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/nad.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" /> Nadm. výška: 1400 &#8211; 2100 m n.m.<br />\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-9573\" src=\"https://www.25coffee.sk/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/odroda.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" /> Odroda: rôzne<br />\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-9576\" src=\"https://www.25coffee.sk/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/chut.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" /> Chuť: čokoláda, orechy, kešu<br />\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-9577\" src=\"https://www.25coffee.sk/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/sprac.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" /> Spracovanie: washed &#8211; sugarcane decaf<br />\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-11067\" src=\"https://www.25coffee.sk/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"18\" height=\"21\" />  Farmár: drobní farmári</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
